NumIdleAGVs [SimTalk]
Returns the number of AGVs of the AGVPool designated by <Path> for which the attribute IsIdle returned
true.
Type
Read-only attribute
Syntax
<Path>.NumIdleAGVs → integer
Watchable
The read-only attribute is watchable.
Return Value
The return value has the data type integer.
Example
waituntil AGVPool.NumIdleAGVs > 0
var AGV := AGVPool.getIdleAGV
SimTalk
IsIdle [SimTalk] - Transporter
getIdleAGV [SimTalk]
